<h2>2. Synthesia — Best for Faceless Presenter Video</h2>
<p>Synthesia builds a presenter video from a script: pick an avatar and a background, paste the text, and the avatar speaks it. That removes the camera, the studio and the on-camera talent from the workflow entirely, which is why it is the tool most often named when creators ask how to run a channel without appearing on it.</p>
<p>The tiers are credit-based and the conversion is published: Basic is free with about 10 minutes of video a month and a watermark; Starter is $19/month (1,250 credits, roughly 12 minutes of avatar footage) with 125+ avatars and no watermark; Pro is $89/month (6,000 credits, roughly 60 minutes) and adds 5 personal avatars. Language coverage is 140+, not the 160+ that older guides still quote.</p>

