<h2>3. Submagic — Best for Shorts from Long Videos</h2>
<p>Submagic handles the two jobs a shorts workflow needs: word-level animated captions, and Magic Clips, which finds highlights in a long recording and cuts them into vertical clips. Publishing to TikTok and Reels happens inside the app, so a 40-minute podcast can become five shorts without leaving the browser.</p>
<p>The pricing is credits, and the conversion is published: Starter is $19/month ($12/month billed yearly) for 45 credits, which Submagic converts to about 15 captioned videos or 5 Magic Clips; Pro is $39/month ($23 yearly) for 120 credits; Business is $69/month ($41 yearly) for 300 credits. A Magic Clip costs more credits than a single captioned video, which is the detail that surprises people after month one.</p>

