<h2>4. Descript — Best for Editing Long-Form</h2>
<p>Descript's trick is that the transcript is the timeline: delete a sentence of text and the corresponding video is cut. For talking-head videos, interviews and podcasts, that is faster than scrubbing a timeline, and it doubles as a captioning tool with 25-language transcription and 61-language caption translation.</p>
<p>Free covers 60 media minutes a month at 720p with a watermark on nothing but a resolution cap; Hobbyist is $16/month billed annually ($24 monthly) for 600 minutes and 1080p; Creator is $24/month annual ($35 monthly) for 1,800 minutes, 4K export and the fuller AI toolset. Media minutes, not videos, are the budget unit.</p>

