<h2>7. Canva AI — Best for Thumbnails and Channel Assets</h2>
<p>Thumbnails are a volume problem more than an art problem: you need a consistent template, a readable face-or-object focal point, and a size that survives mobile. Canva handles that with templates, Magic Resize for repurposing one design across platforms, background removal and Magic Write for copy on the card.</p>
<p>Free covers 1,000+ design types and 1.6M+ templates; Pro adds the full template and asset library, 5 brand kits, 100 GB storage and a larger AI allowance. Pro is sold annually — check canva.com for your local price, since the storefront quotes in local currency.</p>

